flowchart TB
  accTitle: Calendar updates
  accDescr: Local extraction proposes a calendar change. Ambiguous evidence goes to human review. A supported invitation is matched to the calendar, where current events are skipped and changes are written and read back by ID.
  mail["Read email and invitation"] --> extract["Extract dates, time zone<br/>and invitation evidence locally"]
  extract --> proof{"Event<br/>identifiable?"}
  proof -.->|Unclear| review["Hold for human review"]
  proof -->|Supported| match["Match event ID and version<br/>for invitation updates"]
  match -->|Already current| noop["Skip write"]
  match -->|Change verified| write["Update Google Calendar"]
  write --> verify["Read back by event ID"]
